(5029907, 733699, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the color contrasts, but perhaps the face of the coin could have used a bit more light for contrast.</td>', 'I love the color contrasts, but perhaps the face of the coin could have used a bit more light for contrast.', '2008-10-29 00:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
