(5029948, 734579, 94265, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea and well executed, the sharpness is great, especially on the needle (no pun intended.)</td>', 'Fantastic idea and well executed, the sharpness is great, especially on the needle (no pun intended.)', '2008-10-29 00:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
