(5030521, 734645, 34337, '<td valign="top">Like how this looks old.  Good style.</td>', 'Like how this looks old.  Good style.', '2008-10-29 09:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030556, 734641, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity of this one, the simple idea, the framing.</td>', 'I like the clarity of this one, the simple idea, the framing.', '2008-10-29 09:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030567, 734568, 34337, '<td valign="top">well done.</td>', 'well done.', '2008-10-29 09:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030569, 734483, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this one, but I can''t help but think of a traffic cone when I see it. I think that a different angle would benefit this shot, or adding different lines (tilt the dollar so that it is a little more visually engaging than just straight up and down). Also, I think the black band is a little distracting, I would have liked some tape in the back to keep it rolled up so we couldn''t see it.</td>', 'I like the idea of this one, but I can''t help but think of a traffic cone when I see it. I think that a different angle would benefit this shot, or adding different lines (tilt the dollar so that it is a little more visually engaging than just straight up and down). Also, I think the black band is a little distracting, I would have liked some tape in the back to keep it rolled up so we couldn''t see it.', '2008-10-29 09:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030570, 734077, 98141, '<td valign="top">I originally had a similar idea, that is doing origami with a dollar bill. I like the use of the black backdrop and the lighting is good. I''m no pro at post-processing, but I feel that the contrast might be a little high? Something about it makes me lose the clarity of the object.</td>', 'I originally had a similar idea, that is doing origami with a dollar bill. I like the use of the black backdrop and the lighting is good. I''m no pro at post-processing, but I feel that the contrast might be a little high? Something about it makes me lose the clarity of the object.', '2008-10-29 09:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030572, 733219, 34337, '<td valign="top">Love what the color inversion did to the money.  Might be even cooler without the hand in there.</td>', 'Love what the color inversion did to the money.  Might be even cooler without the hand in there.', '2008-10-29 09:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030574, 734212, 98141, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if the shadow wasn''t behind her, perhaps I would move the backrop further away from her body or use a fill light to get it out?</td>', 'I would like this better if the shadow wasn''t behind her, perhaps I would move the backrop further away from her body or use a fill light to get it out?', '2008-10-29 09:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030575, 733663, 34337, '<td valign="top">Stretching the challenge just a bit.  But a very good photo.</td>', 'Stretching the challenge just a bit.  But a very good photo.', '2008-10-29 09:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030576, 734421, 98141, '<td valign="top">Out of focus? A plain background would have made more emphasis.</td>', 'Out of focus? A plain background would have made more emphasis.', '2008-10-29 09:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030577, 734293, 96664, '<td valign="top">Just to plain for me but fit the challenge perfect... (4)</td>', 'Just to plain for me but fit the challenge perfect... (4)', '2008-10-29 09:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030579, 733499, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, I like the way the colors turned out.</td>', 'Interesting idea, I like the way the colors turned out.', '2008-10-29 09:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030581, 734239, 34337, '<td valign="top">Stretching the challenge a bit.  But a good photo.</td>', 'Stretching the challenge a bit.  But a good photo.', '2008-10-29 09:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030582, 733615, 98141, '<td valign="top">Looks good, good lighting, good framing, I like it.</td>', 'Looks good, good lighting, good framing, I like it.', '2008-10-29 09:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030583, 734744, 34337, '<td valign="top">Background color doesn''t seem to fit with subjects.  Photo is very sharp - good focus.</td>', 'Background color doesn''t seem to fit with subjects.  Photo is very sharp - good focus.', '2008-10-29 09:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030584, 733562, 98141, '<td valign="top">I would like it better if her body filled the frame on the left. Also I think the effect would be better if we could see more of her body, and I promise I''m not just saying that to be shallow ;) Also, I''m not sure how it works in Europe, but in the states it would be more common to put one dollar bills into a panty string and save the 20s for something else, I don''t think those wind up in panty strings too often.</td>', 'I would like it better if her body filled the frame on the left. Also I think the effect would be better if we could see more of her body, and I promise I''m not just saying that to be shallow ;) Also, I''m not sure how it works in Europe, but in the states it would be more common to put one dollar bills into a panty string and save the 20s for something else, I don''t think those wind up in panty strings too often.', '2008-10-29 09:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030586, 734408, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the title a lot. I think I would prefer the pic if the top of the glass wasn''t there, if we could only see under the surface of the water.</td>', 'I like the title a lot. I think I would prefer the pic if the top of the glass wasn''t there, if we could only see under the surface of the water.', '2008-10-29 09:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030587, 733581, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice use of focus, nice hues.</td>', 'Nice use of focus, nice hues.', '2008-10-29 09:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030589, 734589, 99311, '<td valign="top">Nice concept ..</td>', 'Nice concept ..', '2008-10-29 09:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030590, 733156, 34337, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Looks about right.</td>', 'Ha!  Looks about right.', '2008-10-29 09:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030594, 734274, 98141, '<td valign="top">That''s the highest denomination I''ve seen in this challenge yet! I like the colors and hwo effectively the foreground stands out against the background.</td>', 'That''s the highest denomination I''ve seen in this challenge yet! I like the colors and hwo effectively the foreground stands out against the background.', '2008-10-29 09:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030596, 734507, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the vastness of it. Looks like a lot of work! I would like if the towers were the part that were the most sharply in focus.</td>', 'I like the vastness of it. Looks like a lot of work! I would like if the towers were the part that were the most sharply in focus.', '2008-10-29 09:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030600, 734726, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this.</td>', 'I like the lighting on this.', '2008-10-29 09:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030601, 734651, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this.', '2008-10-29 09:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030603, 734579, 34337, '<td valign="top">Clever setup - like the theme.</td>', 'Clever setup - like the theme.', '2008-10-29 09:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030615, 734504, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nothing really feels like the focus of this shot to me. The pixels also appear really big as if it were blown up from a really small pic. I also think that a different color for the background would have made the gold pop more.</td>', 'Nothing really feels like the focus of this shot to me. The pixels also appear really big as if it were blown up from a really small pic. I also think that a different color for the background would have made the gold pop more.', '2008-10-29 10:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030622, 734431, 98141, '<td valign="top">Under two? Where do you live (I think that might be a Texas plate?), and please send me some of that! :)</td>', 'Under two? Where do you live (I think that might be a Texas plate?), and please send me some of that! :)', '2008-10-29 10:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030624, 733297, 98141, '<td valign="top">My mom would freak out if she saw this, she hates the idea of putting money in your mouth. I suppose she''s right that we never really know where it''s been... I like that the frame is filled by the paper money, bright colors, great model!</td>', 'My mom would freak out if she saw this, she hates the idea of putting money in your mouth. I suppose she''s right that we never really know where it''s been... I like that the frame is filled by the paper money, bright colors, great model!', '2008-10-29 10:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030635, 734647, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a different take on the challenge. I would prefer to see a different frame - fill the upper left corner and perhaps include the sid eo fthe tarrot card?</td>', 'Nice to see a different take on the challenge. I would prefer to see a different frame - fill the upper left corner and perhaps include the sid eo fthe tarrot card?', '2008-10-29 10:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030637, 734752, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice place. I think if the house were less centered in the pic or if the shot were more from the front directly (more symmetrical) it would be more of a visual impact.</td>', 'Wow, very nice place. I think if the house were less centered in the pic or if the shot were more from the front directly (more symmetrical) it would be more of a visual impact.', '2008-10-29 10:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030641, 733874, 98141, '<td valign="top">Where is everybody getting these golden eggs? They look great. I like the amount of light reflecting. Good choice of color for the background, makes an impact.</td>', 'Where is everybody getting these golden eggs? They look great. I like the amount of light reflecting. Good choice of color for the background, makes an impact.', '2008-10-29 10:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030645, 734177, 98141, '<td valign="top">Such a tiny little piggy! In advanced physics in high school (so long ago now) we used to have this bowl that would reflect things and make them appear in 3-d, like a hologram, above it. We always used a little piggy like this one.</td>', 'Such a tiny little piggy! In advanced physics in high school (so long ago now) we used to have this bowl that would reflect things and make them appear in 3-d, like a hologram, above it. We always used a little piggy like this one.', '2008-10-29 10:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030646, 734474, 98141, '<td valign="top">Like the shadow especially. Also, nice folding job so the words showed up in a good spot.</td>', 'Like the shadow especially. Also, nice folding job so the words showed up in a good spot.', '2008-10-29 10:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030648, 734482, 98141, '<td valign="top">That the 463 side of the paper seems more in focus than the center of the paper I think takes away from the pic.</td>', 'That the 463 side of the paper seems more in focus than the center of the paper I think takes away from the pic.', '2008-10-29 10:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030650, 734535, 98141, '<td valign="top">Another cool take on "Money Laudering." I wish our money had elephants on it! Nice use of the frame, I like that you filled it completely. Also, now you take the lead for highest denomination of US$ that I''ve seen in the challenge so far!</td>', 'Another cool take on "Money Laudering." I wish our money had elephants on it! Nice use of the frame, I like that you filled it completely. Also, now you take the lead for highest denomination of US$ that I''ve seen in the challenge so far!', '2008-10-29 10:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030655, 734514, 98141, '<td valign="top">Aw, the piggy looks so happy, he has no idea what''s about to become of him. Nice lighting, especially the back lighting to emphasize the hammer.</td>', 'Aw, the piggy looks so happy, he has no idea what''s about to become of him. Nice lighting, especially the back lighting to emphasize the hammer.', '2008-10-29 10:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030658, 734474, 56275, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, and I like the composition. Just wish the shadow was more straight. Guessing the background is curved posterboard?</td>', 'Neat idea, and I like the composition. Just wish the shadow was more straight. Guessing the background is curved posterboard?', '2008-10-29 10:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030659, 734751, 98141, '<td valign="top">That looks like a very old dollar, but do I see that it''s only from 2003? I think space from the edge should be even on all sides for greater impact.</td>', 'That looks like a very old dollar, but do I see that it''s only from 2003? I think space from the edge should be even on all sides for greater impact.', '2008-10-29 10:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030663, 734495, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice shine on the eggs.</td>', 'Nice shine on the eggs.', '2008-10-29 10:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030665, 734579, 56275, '<td valign="top">"Stimulus package" =)</td>', '"Stimulus package" =)', '2008-10-29 10:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030670, 734239, 98141, '<td valign="top">To me, this seems to be pushing it as far as meeting the challenge description. Also, I don''t get the sense that anything stands out as the real subject of the shot.</td>', 'To me, this seems to be pushing it as far as meeting the challenge description. Also, I don''t get the sense that anything stands out as the real subject of the shot.', '2008-10-29 10:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030674, 734645, 98141, '<td valign="top">I feel that the upper left corner would look better filled. I like the antiquated colors and the shadow on the side of the box.</td>', 'I feel that the upper left corner would look better filled. I like the antiquated colors and the shadow on the side of the box.', '2008-10-29 10:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030678, 734412, 98141, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2008-10-29 10:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030683, 734661, 98141, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors on this: the way the umbrella matches some of the bills.</td>', 'I really like the colors on this: the way the umbrella matches some of the bills.', '2008-10-29 10:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030689, 733582, 98141, '<td valign="top">If the background were a solid color and the subject''s clothes were different, I think the effect would seem less college dorm-ish.</td>', 'If the background were a solid color and the subject''s clothes were different, I think the effect would seem less college dorm-ish.', '2008-10-29 10:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030692, 734628, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ooh, very nice. I like this one. I like the slanting lines and the way you can see the penny clearly, but not at all, all at once. My favorite so far!</td>', 'Ooh, very nice. I like this one. I like the slanting lines and the way you can see the penny clearly, but not at all, all at once. My favorite so far!', '2008-10-29 10:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030694, 734609, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the b&amp;w for this.</td>', 'I like the b&w for this.', '2008-10-29 10:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030698, 734746, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like that the frame on top is filled by the plant. I like the contrast with the background. Very nice :)</td>', 'I like that the frame on top is filled by the plant. I like the contrast with the background. Very nice :)', '2008-10-29 10:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030702, 734745, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think I would like to see this with a square fram, centered. The symmetrical nature of the coin, imho, lends itself to such a frame.</td>', 'I think I would like to see this with a square fram, centered. The symmetrical nature of the coin, imho, lends itself to such a frame.', '2008-10-29 10:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
