(5032553, 734490, 99503, '<td valign="top">A very good image, the background is a brilliant colour and the idea with the coins is great.</td>', 'A very good image, the background is a brilliant colour and the idea with the coins is great.', '2008-10-30 06:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
