(5032564, 734641, 99503, '<td valign="top">A very good photo, well lighted and very sharp. Well done.</td>', 'A very good photo, well lighted and very sharp. Well done.', '2008-10-30 06:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032565, 734547, 99503, '<td valign="top">A brilliant shot, the depth of field at the front is very nice and I love the colour and lighting of the background.</td>', 'A brilliant shot, the depth of field at the front is very nice and I love the colour and lighting of the background.', '2008-10-30 06:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032566, 733663, 99503, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, great colours in the crowd and very sharp.</td>', 'Very nice photo, great colours in the crowd and very sharp.', '2008-10-30 06:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032567, 734751, 99503, '<td valign="top">An interesting capture, although it may be a little too bright.</td>', 'An interesting capture, although it may be a little too bright.', '2008-10-30 06:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032568, 733581, 99503, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture here. The photo exactly suits the title and the subject is very sharp.</td>', 'Very nice capture here. The photo exactly suits the title and the subject is very sharp.', '2008-10-30 06:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032760, 734179, 811, '<td valign="top">it *almost* looks oversharpened. Otherwise, I like the lighting and composition.</td>', 'it *almost* looks oversharpened. Otherwise, I like the lighting and composition.', '2008-10-30 10:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032797, 734635, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Good eye, catching this opportunity and placing what appears to be a diner waitress holding a cigarette, something you wouldn''t see here in California. First I was thinking it was a "Well?" gesture, but I think it''s examining the tip jar.  It''s good the focus is on the woman rather than the jar but the writing is still legible.</td>', 'I like it.  Good eye, catching this opportunity and placing what appears to be a diner waitress holding a cigarette, something you wouldn''t see here in California. First I was thinking it was a "Well?" gesture, but I think it''s examining the tip jar.  It''s good the focus is on the woman rather than the jar but the writing is still legible.', '2008-10-30 11:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032798, 733447, 16402, '<td valign="top">I like it. A creative and well executed abastact. 7</td>', 'I like it. A creative and well executed abastact. 7', '2008-10-30 11:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032807, 734579, 36606, '<td valign="top">brilliant idea. 10</td>', 'brilliant idea. 10', '2008-10-30 11:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032808, 733562, 36606, '<td valign="top">haha love it.</td>', 'haha love it.', '2008-10-30 11:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032842, 733403, 100036, '<td valign="top">Wow amazing shot.....</td>', 'Wow amazing shot.....', '2008-10-30 11:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032913, 733663, 3102, '<td valign="top">A really nice shot, but a complete shoehorn into the challenge.</td>', 'A really nice shot, but a complete shoehorn into the challenge.', '2008-10-30 12:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033023, 733250, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition is a little weak, but I love the elegant lighting, the tones, and the shallow DOF.</td>', 'The composition is a little weak, but I love the elegant lighting, the tones, and the shallow DOF.', '2008-10-30 14:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033027, 734412, 63269, '<td valign="top">I would personally suggest a different, more neutral colored background, and also the focus is a little off due to the angle. Perhaps shooting the face with the camera directly above will remove this problem with depth of field.</td>', 'I would personally suggest a different, more neutral colored background, and also the focus is a little off due to the angle. Perhaps shooting the face with the camera directly above will remove this problem with depth of field.', '2008-10-30 14:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033036, 734202, 63269, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this might have looked better in color? The contrast is very low and lighting needs a little work. Perhaps try lighting the subject from different angles instead of using the head-on flash.</td>', 'I wonder if this might have looked better in color? The contrast is very low and lighting needs a little work. Perhaps try lighting the subject from different angles instead of using the head-on flash.', '2008-10-30 14:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033040, 733148, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow dof, and the lighting''s okay, but I think this would do better if there was a stronger composition.</td>', 'I like the shallow dof, and the lighting''s okay, but I think this would do better if there was a stronger composition.', '2008-10-30 14:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033042, 734579, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very nice set-up, superb lighting and focus. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice set-up, superb lighting and focus. Well done.', '2008-10-30 14:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033044, 734645, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity and the detail.</td>', 'I like the clarity and the detail.', '2008-10-30 14:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033047, 733949, 63269, '<td valign="top">You have the right idea here, with the neat angle and composition, I just might suggest not cropping quite so tightly, so that the money isn''t cut off. Otherwise not bad.</td>', 'You have the right idea here, with the neat angle and composition, I just might suggest not cropping quite so tightly, so that the money isn''t cut off. Otherwise not bad.', '2008-10-30 14:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033049, 733987, 63269, '<td valign="top">The bright colors and high contrast are a little too strong here in my opinion. I would also suggest trying a different composition.</td>', 'The bright colors and high contrast are a little too strong here in my opinion. I would also suggest trying a different composition.', '2008-10-30 14:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033058, 733462, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well... here''s my two cents...:)<br/>I''m not sure I like the composition. It''s a little akward, and when I first opened the thumbnail, it took me a a sec to figure it out. Alright, it was just a second, but I think instant impact is more memorable, and the subject certainly has the potential to really impact. Also, the contrast doesn''t look quite right. highlights that should be white are a muted gray, giving the image a sort of dull quality. However, the actual lighting set-up looks and works perfectly, and the subject - coins in place of eyes - is extremely intriguing and captivating. Very neat! :)</td>', 'Well... here''s my two cents...:)I''m not sure I like the composition. It''s a little akward, and when I first opened the thumbnail, it took me a a sec to figure it out. Alright, it was just a second, but I think instant impact is more memorable, and the subject certainly has the potential to really impact. Also, the contrast doesn''t look quite right. highlights that should be white are a muted gray, giving the image a sort of dull quality. However, the actual lighting set-up looks and works perfectly, and the subject - coins in place of eyes - is extremely intriguing and captivating. Very neat! :)', '2008-10-30 14:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033066, 733874, 63269, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and color. You''ve made everything look nice and sparkly. My only suggestion - and this is totally personal, maybe I''m nitpicking here - would be to crop a little of the right and left. Give the impression that there''s a long line of gold spread out, instead of just a little pile. Just a thought... Nice image.</td>', 'Great lighting and color. You''ve made everything look nice and sparkly. My only suggestion - and this is totally personal, maybe I''m nitpicking here - would be to crop a little of the right and left. Give the impression that there''s a long line of gold spread out, instead of just a little pile. Just a thought... Nice image.', '2008-10-30 14:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033068, 733581, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well done - great composition, color, and focus.</td>', 'Well done - great composition, color, and focus.', '2008-10-30 14:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033069, 733699, 63269, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lighting! Beautifully done.</td>', 'Gorgeous lighting! Beautifully done.', '2008-10-30 14:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033073, 734744, 63269, '<td valign="top">I personally might have chosen a different background color - perhaps a neutral red or copper color - something that would compliment the beautiful colors of the leaf. But great lighting and focus.</td>', 'I personally might have chosen a different background color - perhaps a neutral red or copper color - something that would compliment the beautiful colors of the leaf. But great lighting and focus.', '2008-10-30 14:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033076, 734535, 63269, '<td valign="top">Just a tad more contrast maybe - but this is great!</td>', 'Just a tad more contrast maybe - but this is great!', '2008-10-30 14:28:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5033084, 734357, 63269, '<td valign="top">personally, I think a little deeper depth of field would work better here, to get the person completely in focus. Also, this isn''t really that important, but a more interesting background might help strengthen the concept. Nice even lighting though!</td>', 'personally, I think a little deeper depth of field would work better here, to get the person completely in focus. Also, this isn''t really that important, but a more interesting background might help strengthen the concept. Nice even lighting though!', '2008-10-30 14:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033085, 734661, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little harsh, but I love the color work.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little harsh, but I love the color work.', '2008-10-30 14:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033089, 733005, 63269, '<td valign="top">Superb contrast. The composition is a little weak though... might be interesting to shoot the dollar bills on an angle, with unfocused dishes and glasses in the background, to strengthen the restaurant/tipping concept? Just a thought. :)</td>', 'Superb contrast. The composition is a little weak though... might be interesting to shoot the dollar bills on an angle, with unfocused dishes and glasses in the background, to strengthen the restaurant/tipping concept? Just a thought. :)', '2008-10-30 14:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033090, 734482, 63269, '<td valign="top">Although I like the wrinkle, my only complaint is that the focus doesn''t seem to be perfectly sharp on the face. otherwise, nicely done.</td>', 'Although I like the wrinkle, my only complaint is that the focus doesn''t seem to be perfectly sharp on the face. otherwise, nicely done.', '2008-10-30 14:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033092, 733147, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat lighting. I might suggest making sure the subject is more precisely centered, or better yet creating a more interesting composition using the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Neat lighting. I might suggest making sure the subject is more precisely centered, or better yet creating a more interesting composition using the rule of thirds.', '2008-10-30 14:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
