(5033575, 734483, 63269, '<td valign="top">Everyone else entered photographs depicting how "scarce" money is, and here you are, burning it! ;D Excellent, nicely set-up photo - I hope you didn''t have to burn through too much cash to get this! :)</td>', 'Everyone else entered photographs depicting how "scarce" money is, and here you are, burning it! ;D Excellent, nicely set-up photo - I hope you didn''t have to burn through too much cash to get this! :)', '2008-10-30 19:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033577, 734433, 63269, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this might have looked in color? Or maybe this just needs some more contrast. There seems to be an excess of gray mid-tones, giving this image a slightly dull look. Terrific concept though and wonderful composition and focus.</td>', 'I wonder how this might have looked in color? Or maybe this just needs some more contrast. There seems to be an excess of gray mid-tones, giving this image a slightly dull look. Terrific concept though and wonderful composition and focus.', '2008-10-30 19:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033579, 733551, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done - the simplicity and the color tones are classy.</td>', 'Beautifully done - the simplicity and the color tones are classy.', '2008-10-30 19:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033580, 734601, 63269, '<td valign="top">I admit I don''t care for the background, but the angle is very interesting, and the concept is very cleverly portrayed. Well done.</td>', 'I admit I don''t care for the background, but the angle is very interesting, and the concept is very cleverly portrayed. Well done.', '2008-10-30 19:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033582, 734475, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition is a little cluttered, and it''s kind of difficult for the viewer to figure out what they''re really looking at here. However I like the concept, and the brown and silver colors and tones work great together.</td>', 'The composition is a little cluttered, and it''s kind of difficult for the viewer to figure out what they''re really looking at here. However I like the concept, and the brown and silver colors and tones work great together.', '2008-10-30 19:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033587, 734726, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little harsh, and a little too dark I think, but perhaps that was intended. It just makes the tape look a little funny, and creates strong shadows on the face. Neat concept, and great composition and angle.</td>', 'The lighting is a little harsh, and a little too dark I think, but perhaps that was intended. It just makes the tape look a little funny, and creates strong shadows on the face. Neat concept, and great composition and angle.', '2008-10-30 19:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033741, 734666, 76430, '<td valign="top">It took a second look to see you lined up the numbers in the corners from 10 down to 1 I presume.  Good DOF.</td>', 'It took a second look to see you lined up the numbers in the corners from 10 down to 1 I presume.  Good DOF.', '2008-10-30 22:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033745, 734177, 76430, '<td valign="top">There is too much empty space here.  I''d like to see it zoomed in on the subject.  I don''t really understand the title.</td>', 'There is too much empty space here.  I''d like to see it zoomed in on the subject.  I don''t really understand the title.', '2008-10-30 22:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033760, 734484, 76430, '<td valign="top">I wish I could tell what they are contracting.  nuts?  Maybe if you cropped it above their heads and expanded the rest I could see it better.  Very interesting environment though.</td>', 'I wish I could tell what they are contracting.  nuts?  Maybe if you cropped it above their heads and expanded the rest I could see it better.  Very interesting environment though.', '2008-10-30 23:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033764, 734212, 76430, '<td valign="top">Ouch, really harsh camera flash.  Nice smile and pose.</td>', 'Ouch, really harsh camera flash.  Nice smile and pose.', '2008-10-30 23:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033780, 734751, 76430, '<td valign="top">Strange, I can see both the front and back.  Is it backlit?  That makes it really hard to see clearly even though you have the focus very good.</td>', 'Strange, I can see both the front and back.  Is it backlit?  That makes it really hard to see clearly even though you have the focus very good.', '2008-10-30 23:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
