(5033919, 733499, 100053, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Lighting gives it away a little too easily. Maybe less direct lighting and more side, and/or back "separation" lighting.</td>', 'Great idea. Lighting gives it away a little too easily. Maybe less direct lighting and more side, and/or back "separation" lighting.', '2008-10-31 03:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033920, 734362, 100053, '<td valign="top">Very nice color, composition, a true "how did he do that?"</td>', 'Very nice color, composition, a true "how did he do that?"', '2008-10-31 03:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033922, 734474, 100053, '<td valign="top">Nice depth to the photo and caption.</td>', 'Nice depth to the photo and caption.', '2008-10-31 03:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033923, 734408, 100053, '<td valign="top">Very busy, bubbles on glass and background do not allow to focus on subject.</td>', 'Very busy, bubbles on glass and background do not allow to focus on subject.', '2008-10-31 03:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033924, 733634, 100053, '<td valign="top">Good composition, good lighting, A shallow depth of field may have more impact.</td>', 'Good composition, good lighting, A shallow depth of field may have more impact.', '2008-10-31 03:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033925, 734601, 100053, '<td valign="top">Very Creative, The red in the skin draws the eye away from the subject a bit. Maybe an overall vignette, or desaturation of the skin. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Very Creative, The red in the skin draws the eye away from the subject a bit. Maybe an overall vignette, or desaturation of the skin. Keep up the good work!', '2008-10-31 03:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033926, 734597, 100053, '<td valign="top">Great composition and depth.</td>', 'Great composition and depth.', '2008-10-31 03:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033927, 734704, 100053, '<td valign="top">Great use of color for mood. Image seems tilted lower to the left. Shadow top left adds to unsettling effect.</td>', 'Great use of color for mood. Image seems tilted lower to the left. Shadow top left adds to unsettling effect.', '2008-10-31 03:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033928, 734212, 100053, '<td valign="top">Moving subject away from backdrop or adjusting light will do away with shadows on left.</td>', 'Moving subject away from backdrop or adjusting light will do away with shadows on left.', '2008-10-31 03:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033929, 734640, 100053, '<td valign="top">Keep an eye on the edges of photos. The lamp cut off draws the eye out of the image.</td>', 'Keep an eye on the edges of photos. The lamp cut off draws the eye out of the image.', '2008-10-31 03:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033930, 733614, 100053, '<td valign="top">Good selective focus, lighting, and composition.</td>', 'Good selective focus, lighting, and composition.', '2008-10-31 03:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034041, 734752, 66709, '<td valign="top">If you got 5 Million dollar in an inflation world</td>', 'If you got 5 Million dollar in an inflation world', '2008-10-31 07:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034138, 733148, 98986, '<td valign="top">that is a good view.</td>', 'that is a good view.', '2008-10-31 09:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034139, 734568, 98986, '<td valign="top">i have no idea what that is, but it''s still good!</td>', 'i have no idea what that is, but it''s still good!', '2008-10-31 09:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034140, 734279, 98986, '<td valign="top">i like how the background color blends in with the money.</td>', 'i like how the background color blends in with the money.', '2008-10-31 09:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034301, 734590, 100066, '<td valign="top">You captured an amazing perspective and superb reflections,<br/>Congrats ,<br/>Zeynep</td>', 'You captured an amazing perspective and superb reflections,Congrats ,Zeynep', '2008-10-31 11:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034311, 733005, 99351, '<td valign="top">just ask at almost any bank. they reprinted them not too long ago</td>', 'just ask at almost any bank. they reprinted them not too long ago', '2008-10-31 11:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034400, 734590, 18197, '<td valign="top">I used to put coins on the railroad track as a kid. Thanks for the memory!</td>', 'I used to put coins on the railroad track as a kid. Thanks for the memory!', '2008-10-31 13:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034407, 733172, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but the focus seems a little off. Shallow depth of field is fine as long as something is in sharp focus.</td>', 'Good concept, but the focus seems a little off. Shallow depth of field is fine as long as something is in sharp focus.', '2008-10-31 13:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034408, 733467, 18197, '<td valign="top">The notion you''re conveying seems fine, but the image would be better if it were brighter, IMO.</td>', 'The notion you''re conveying seems fine, but the image would be better if it were brighter, IMO.', '2008-10-31 13:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034412, 733663, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good photo, well cropped and presented. But to my way of thinking, not especially relevant to the theme.</td>', 'Good photo, well cropped and presented. But to my way of thinking, not especially relevant to the theme.', '2008-10-31 13:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034419, 734526, 18197, '<td valign="top">If you''ve tried stinking poor and stinking rich ... you may find rich is better, but I digress. Interesting take on the challenge. Nice focus and DOF. Composition''s good enough. Not sure the subject will resonate with voters.</td>', 'If you''ve tried stinking poor and stinking rich ... you may find rich is better, but I digress. Interesting take on the challenge. Nice focus and DOF. Composition''s good enough. Not sure the subject will resonate with voters.', '2008-10-31 13:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034474, 734495, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition isn''t very engaging, but this is very nicely lit!</td>', 'The composition isn''t very engaging, but this is very nicely lit!', '2008-10-31 14:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034477, 734421, 63269, '<td valign="top">This might look nicer if it were more clearly focused, and also if there was a different background. I also might suggest shooting this arrangement from the other side, so that it isn''t backlit. The way you stacked the coins, however, is really neat!</td>', 'This might look nicer if it were more clearly focused, and also if there was a different background. I also might suggest shooting this arrangement from the other side, so that it isn''t backlit. The way you stacked the coins, however, is really neat!', '2008-10-31 14:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034482, 734734, 63269, '<td valign="top">Terrific colors, clarity,  and detail.</td>', 'Terrific colors, clarity,  and detail.', '2008-10-31 14:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034484, 734732, 63269, '<td valign="top">This almost looks just slightly out of focus, but otherwise I like the unique composition and angle.</td>', 'This almost looks just slightly out of focus, but otherwise I like the unique composition and angle.', '2008-10-31 14:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034486, 734568, 63269, '<td valign="top">I think a better composition might help this image have more of an impact.</td>', 'I think a better composition might help this image have more of an impact.', '2008-10-31 14:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034489, 734402, 63269, '<td valign="top">STUNNING lighting, and beautiful, rich colors. Nicely done.</td>', 'STUNNING lighting, and beautiful, rich colors. Nicely done.', '2008-10-31 14:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034491, 734252, 63269, '<td valign="top">I think a stronger composition might help out here - perhaps put the subject on just one side of the photo, using the rule of thirds. Also, I wonder if a little more contrast might make this visually pop a little more.</td>', 'I think a stronger composition might help out here - perhaps put the subject on just one side of the photo, using the rule of thirds. Also, I wonder if a little more contrast might make this visually pop a little more.', '2008-10-31 14:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034495, 734408, 63269, '<td valign="top">Maybe you intended this, but I think the background, showing through the glass, is a little too cluttered. It makes the composition a little confusing - my eye doesn''t know where to rest. The lighting and clarity of focus are lovely though.</td>', 'Maybe you intended this, but I think the background, showing through the glass, is a little too cluttered. It makes the composition a little confusing - my eye doesn''t know where to rest. The lighting and clarity of focus are lovely though.', '2008-10-31 14:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034500, 734666, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - this looks classy in black and white.</td>', 'Nicely done - this looks classy in black and white.', '2008-10-31 14:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034503, 733156, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful - the black and white is perfect and the border compliments it nicely.</td>', 'Very beautiful - the black and white is perfect and the border compliments it nicely.', '2008-10-31 14:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034504, 734527, 63269, '<td valign="top"><i>Incredible</i> lighting and awesome colors and tones. Expertly done.</td>', 'Incredible lighting and awesome colors and tones. Expertly done.', '2008-10-31 14:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034506, 733805, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love it! What neat textures - you''ve captured the detail very nicely here. My only complaint is the composition. I might suggest straightening the coin out a little.</td>', 'I love it! What neat textures - you''ve captured the detail very nicely here. My only complaint is the composition. I might suggest straightening the coin out a little.', '2008-10-31 14:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034508, 734640, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition isn''t very strong, but those vivid colors are beautiful!</td>', 'The composition isn''t very strong, but those vivid colors are beautiful!', '2008-10-31 14:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034510, 734628, 63269, '<td valign="top">Bravo - very well done! Nice setup and lighting. I know from experience how insanely hard this kind of shot is to get perfect like this....</td>', 'Bravo - very well done! Nice setup and lighting. I know from experience how insanely hard this kind of shot is to get perfect like this....', '2008-10-31 14:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034513, 734459, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very neat! This is a little dark, but I love the composition and focus. Superb.</td>', 'Very neat! This is a little dark, but I love the composition and focus. Superb.', '2008-10-31 14:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034517, 734279, 63269, '<td valign="top">The detail, the tones, and the colors you''ve captured here, are absolutely exquisite. Well done! :)</td>', 'The detail, the tones, and the colors you''ve captured here, are absolutely exquisite. Well done! :)', '2008-10-31 14:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034523, 733218, 63269, '<td valign="top">I really like the shallow depth of field you have going here, but that one strip of coins doesn''t look like it''s quite completely focused. Otherwise this looks very nice.</td>', 'I really like the shallow depth of field you have going here, but that one strip of coins doesn''t look like it''s quite completely focused. Otherwise this looks very nice.', '2008-10-31 14:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034524, 734415, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting!</td>', 'Excellent lighting!', '2008-10-31 14:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034528, 734177, 59276, '<td valign="top">this is sooooo funny. makes me laugh everytime I see it</td>', 'this is sooooo funny. makes me laugh everytime I see it', '2008-10-31 14:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034542, 734733, 59276, '<td valign="top">I like your effect.</td>', 'I like your effect.', '2008-10-31 14:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034543, 734526, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely set up but could use a little more contrast.</td>', 'This is very nicely set up but could use a little more contrast.', '2008-10-31 14:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034548, 734704, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the shallow DOF, the contrast, and the bright colors, but I''m not sure if I like the lighting set-up. The face of the up-right coin is too dark.</td>', 'I love the shallow DOF, the contrast, and the bright colors, but I''m not sure if I like the lighting set-up. The face of the up-right coin is too dark.', '2008-10-31 14:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034549, 733403, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little too dark, imho.</td>', 'The lighting is a little too dark, imho.', '2008-10-31 14:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034550, 733663, 63269, '<td valign="top">Great capture - everything is nicely composed, focused, and lit.</td>', 'Great capture - everything is nicely composed, focused, and lit.', '2008-10-31 14:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034552, 734293, 63269, '<td valign="top">I can understand if you wanted to give the impression of a clutter, but the composition is just a little too busy here. Also a little more contrast might back this pop a little more.</td>', 'I can understand if you wanted to give the impression of a clutter, but the composition is just a little too busy here. Also a little more contrast might back this pop a little more.', '2008-10-31 14:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034553, 733119, 63269, '<td valign="top">Superb photograph!</td>', 'Superb photograph!', '2008-10-31 14:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034555, 734731, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp clean set-up.</td>', 'Nice crisp clean set-up.', '2008-10-31 14:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034556, 734179, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition isn''t very strong, but I love way you''ve used the lighting to create dramatic highlights and contrasts.</td>', 'The composition isn''t very strong, but I love way you''ve used the lighting to create dramatic highlights and contrasts.', '2008-10-31 14:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034557, 734514, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting!</td>', 'Excellent lighting!', '2008-10-31 14:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034558, 734550, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the colors!</td>', 'I love the colors!', '2008-10-31 14:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034560, 734274, 63269, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just me, but the face on the bill looks just slightly over-exposed. Everything else is great though.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just me, but the face on the bill looks just slightly over-exposed. Everything else is great though.', '2008-10-31 14:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034564, 734261, 63269, '<td valign="top">A different composition might make this more interesting - instead of centering the subject, I would suggest shooting it from an angle and maybe even playing around with shallow depth of field.</td>', 'A different composition might make this more interesting - instead of centering the subject, I would suggest shooting it from an angle and maybe even playing around with shallow depth of field.', '2008-10-31 15:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034566, 734745, 63269, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors and metal tones.</td>', 'beautiful colors and metal tones.', '2008-10-31 15:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034568, 733331, 63269, '<td valign="top">Fascinating use of colors and lighting!</td>', 'Fascinating use of colors and lighting!', '2008-10-31 15:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034585, 733805, 99695, '<td valign="top">how come this picture appears twice, with different names: ''survivor'' and ''old timer''??</td>', 'how come this picture appears twice, with different names: ''survivor'' and ''old timer''??', '2008-10-31 15:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034591, 734279, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I like the detail.</td>', 'Nice composition and I like the detail.', '2008-10-31 15:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034596, 734415, 39880, '<td valign="top">I could use some good clean money.  Nice work.</td>', 'I could use some good clean money.  Nice work.', '2008-10-31 15:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034597, 734474, 39880, '<td valign="top">I never knew you could do this to a 20.  Nice shot, I like the composition.</td>', 'I never knew you could do this to a 20.  Nice shot, I like the composition.', '2008-10-31 15:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034739, 734590, 91998, '<td valign="top">Short of having a mate who drives a train stop on the track with his lights on while you took the photo, I can''t work out how you did this? Nice angle</td>', 'Short of having a mate who drives a train stop on the track with his lights on while you took the photo, I can''t work out how you did this? Nice angle', '2008-10-31 16:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
