(5036991, 734661, 26001, '<td valign="top">i hope you did this with "fake" money. excellent concept and very nice composition. i like the color processing but you will get mixed reaction from voters on that part for sure. my only concern with this image is a little overexposed bills in the foreground. <br/>in any case, this should place high. over all very good work. good luck.</td>', 'i hope you did this with "fake" money. excellent concept and very nice composition. i like the color processing but you will get mixed reaction from voters on that part for sure. my only concern with this image is a little overexposed bills in the foreground. in any case, this should place high. over all very good work. good luck.', '2008-11-01 18:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5036992, 734077, 26001, '<td valign="top">very nice origami work and pleasing composition. just a little dark for my taste. not a big deal though.</td>', 'very nice origami work and pleasing composition. just a little dark for my taste. not a big deal though.', '2008-11-01 18:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5036997, 733634, 26001, '<td valign="top">i like the lighting and dof work here. btw nice use of "Crown Royal" bag.</td>', 'i like the lighting and dof work here. btw nice use of "Crown Royal" bag.', '2008-11-01 18:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037002, 734483, 26001, '<td valign="top">hope you did not have to sacrifice more than one one-dollar bill (it surely looks real) for the shot.<br/>I would have appreciated your attention to details, if you had made sure to hide the matchstick. overall, i like this.</td>', 'hope you did not have to sacrifice more than one one-dollar bill (it surely looks real) for the shot.I would have appreciated your attention to details, if you had made sure to hide the matchstick. overall, i like this.', '2008-11-01 18:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037005, 734628, 26001, '<td valign="top">simple and effective. could have easily worked in the other "motion blur" challenge too. this should do well. good luck.</td>', 'simple and effective. could have easily worked in the other "motion blur" challenge too. this should do well. good luck.', '2008-11-01 18:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037185, 734547, 14437, '<td valign="top">Good composition and great lighting. The dark BG created a very nice contrast against the white (notes) and the green. Clever use of dried leaves added a nice touch of brown color to the composition. Nice.</td>', 'Good composition and great lighting. The dark BG created a very nice contrast against the white (notes) and the green. Clever use of dried leaves added a nice touch of brown color to the composition. Nice.', '2008-11-01 20:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037189, 734402, 14437, '<td valign="top">Clever used of flash created a nice BG color. And the composition is nice. The only nit is that note and leaves on the top right is not well lit.</td>', 'Clever used of flash created a nice BG color. And the composition is nice. The only nit is that note and leaves on the top right is not well lit.', '2008-11-01 20:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037191, 734536, 14437, '<td valign="top">Very original image. My first impression of seeing this image was... wow.</td>', 'Very original image. My first impression of seeing this image was... wow.', '2008-11-01 20:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037198, 734597, 14437, '<td valign="top">A simple and nice set up. Good lighting and composition. The reflection made the image here.</td>', 'A simple and nice set up. Good lighting and composition. The reflection made the image here.', '2008-11-01 20:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037251, 733805, 59029, '<td valign="top">love the dof, very nice crisp focus.</td>', 'love the dof, very nice crisp focus.', '2008-11-01 20:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037384, 733172, 35708, '<td valign="top">I find the composition way too noisy and the lack of focus is highly distracting.</td>', 'I find the composition way too noisy and the lack of focus is highly distracting.', '2008-11-01 21:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037389, 733119, 35708, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. It tells a story. Very good.</td>', 'Nice composition. It tells a story. Very good.', '2008-11-01 21:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037393, 733634, 35708, '<td valign="top">This is top notch work. The composition is good, the focus is good, the colors are wonderful, and the lighting is spot on. Very nice work!</td>', 'This is top notch work. The composition is good, the focus is good, the colors are wonderful, and the lighting is spot on. Very nice work!', '2008-11-01 21:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037394, 734641, 35708, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot. I like the way the money is arranged and the over all look and feel of the photo. Nice job.</td>', 'This is a really good shot. I like the way the money is arranged and the over all look and feel of the photo. Nice job.', '2008-11-01 21:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037395, 734550, 35708, '<td valign="top">A really good shot. There really isn''t much I need to say about this that you don''t already know.</td>', 'A really good shot. There really isn''t much I need to say about this that you don''t already know.', '2008-11-01 21:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037507, 734362, 64446, '<td valign="top">That''s and interesting compositionm with a very good focus. Wonder what you used to stick them together: epoxy or buble gum?<br/>Bumping up score...</td>', 'That''s and interesting compositionm with a very good focus. Wonder what you used to stick them together: epoxy or buble gum?Bumping up score...', '2008-11-01 22:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037511, 734415, 64446, '<td valign="top">Very creative. bumping up...</td>', 'Very creative. bumping up...', '2008-11-01 22:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037529, 734579, 35708, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea and awesome implementation. Very nice job!</td>', 'Awesome idea and awesome implementation. Very nice job!', '2008-11-01 22:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037531, 734590, 64446, '<td valign="top">That''s a daring image to take. It really conveys the train is coming - and you are on its way!<br/>I''d like to see that penny after the train passed... lol.</td>', 'That''s a daring image to take. It really conveys the train is coming - and you are on its way!I''d like to see that penny after the train passed... lol.', '2008-11-01 22:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
