(5037843, 734481, 97893, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2008-11-02 01:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037890, 734279, 59029, '<td valign="top">very nice macro, good comp, lots of texture, lighting great in that it brings out the detail without any harsh glare.  The only thing I''m not crazy about is the crop; I know it''s a fine line between ''fill the frame'' and not having too much space around the coins, but I''d like to see space on the right and left.</td>', 'very nice macro, good comp, lots of texture, lighting great in that it brings out the detail without any harsh glare.  The only thing I''m not crazy about is the crop; I know it''s a fine line between ''fill the frame'' and not having too much space around the coins, but I''d like to see space on the right and left.', '2008-11-02 03:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038348, 734641, 74015, '<td valign="top">Or these days: the bank is broke!!</td>', 'Or these days: the bank is broke!!', '2008-11-02 09:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038351, 734635, 74015, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the TIP is not so clear.  I understand what you wanted to do but I am not sure it works effectively...  Still, it tells a story. 6 for me.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the TIP is not so clear.  I understand what you wanted to do but I am not sure it works effectively...  Still, it tells a story. 6 for me.', '2008-11-02 09:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038355, 734515, 74015, '<td valign="top">Too bad you have this shadow across the middle of the face.  it is very distracting.  Interesting atmosphere.</td>', 'Too bad you have this shadow across the middle of the face.  it is very distracting.  Interesting atmosphere.', '2008-11-02 09:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038357, 734484, 74015, '<td valign="top">Lovely street scene and well composed.</td>', 'Lovely street scene and well composed.', '2008-11-02 09:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038364, 733119, 74015, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation on the Money theme.  Your set-up pulls me into a spy movie.  Very effective!  Only complaint: the white-out part just above the table on the left.</td>', 'Nice interpretation on the Money theme.  Your set-up pulls me into a spy movie.  Very effective!  Only complaint: the white-out part just above the table on the left.', '2008-11-02 09:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038368, 734421, 74015, '<td valign="top">Really soft focus.  Could be because this is a very severe crop from your original or a file prep problem for web posting.</td>', 'Really soft focus.  Could be because this is a very severe crop from your original or a file prep problem for web posting.', '2008-11-02 09:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038370, 734751, 74015, '<td valign="top">A little over sharpened IMO.  The overlap of the ONE over the "face" (is it Ben Franklin or Washington?) is distracting.</td>', 'A little over sharpened IMO.  The overlap of the ONE over the "face" (is it Ben Franklin or Washington?) is distracting.', '2008-11-02 09:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038373, 734429, 74015, '<td valign="top">Good title with the selected focus of your image.</td>', 'Good title with the selected focus of your image.', '2008-11-02 09:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038379, 734415, 74015, '<td valign="top">Nice take on a popular expression.  One of my favourite so far.</td>', 'Nice take on a popular expression.  One of my favourite so far.', '2008-11-02 09:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038382, 733214, 74015, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and great details in the second coin from the top right.  It is as if he is looking at me...  Spooky!</td>', 'Excellent lighting and great details in the second coin from the top right.  It is as if he is looking at me...  Spooky!', '2008-11-02 09:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038384, 734391, 74015, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors!</td>', 'Lovely colors!', '2008-11-02 09:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038426, 734579, 64446, '<td valign="top">I found this to be a very creative image, even more in the context of the current economic circunstances. It caught my attention right away and made me laugh too, as it was right on target.<br/>The title, apparently obvious, works very well with it, providing the double meaning you certainly wanted to bring to the viewer. The oof newspaper as the background properly conveys such idea, and it''s nice being in perspective.<br/>I think it would give more dynamics to the image having the seringe not so vertical and central, maybe just tilting a bit in diagonal opposite to the bg.</td>', 'I found this to be a very creative image, even more in the context of the current economic circunstances. It caught my attention right away and made me laugh too, as it was right on target.The title, apparently obvious, works very well with it, providing the double meaning you certainly wanted to bring to the viewer. The oof newspaper as the background properly conveys such idea, and it''s nice being in perspective.I think it would give more dynamics to the image having the seringe not so vertical and central, maybe just tilting a bit in diagonal opposite to the bg.', '2008-11-02 09:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038516, 734294, 6097, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but why the letterboxing?  I like the concept you have here.</td>', 'Nice idea but why the letterboxing?  I like the concept you have here.', '2008-11-02 10:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038529, 733805, 6097, '<td valign="top">It looks like this coin has been used a lot.  I like the DOF here.  I also like the sharpness in the bottom portion of the photo because of the detail it reveals.</td>', 'It looks like this coin has been used a lot.  I like the DOF here.  I also like the sharpness in the bottom portion of the photo because of the detail it reveals.', '2008-11-02 10:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038543, 733634, 6097, '<td valign="top">nice lighting...  I like the contrast of the silver and gold but without the proper lighting that wouldn''t be so evident.  the Crown Royal bag adds a nice touch...</td>', 'nice lighting...  I like the contrast of the silver and gold but without the proper lighting that wouldn''t be so evident.  the Crown Royal bag adds a nice touch...', '2008-11-02 10:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5039039, 734164, 26001, '<td valign="top">very nice macro shot.<br/>wish you had shown something more "interesting" part of the currency bill. especially when the complete texts (Big text-United States or Small text-The United States of Am) are not entirely in focus.</td>', 'very nice macro shot.wish you had shown something more "interesting" part of the currency bill. especially when the complete texts (Big text-United States or Small text-The United States of Am) are not entirely in focus.', '2008-11-02 15:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
