(5042246, 734239, 83313, '<td valign="top"><strike>I''m not sure I get this, except maybe as an outtake from the street photography challenge.</strike> Ok, now I get it. I thought it was the guy on the left that the caption was for, as my eye was drawn to the one visible face in the shot. I see now that it is a caption for the guy on the right, who is looking away, at the girl. Obviously, this shot didn''t work for me.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get this, except maybe as an outtake from the street photography challenge. Ok, now I get it. I thought it was the guy on the left that the caption was for, as my eye was drawn to the one visible face in the shot. I see now that it is a caption for the guy on the right, who is looking away, at the girl. Obviously, this shot didn''t work for me.', '2008-11-03 19:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
