(5044099, 733250, 83313, '<td valign="top">Whoopeeeeee! Ruupeeeeeee! (Ok, I know that was a dumb comment. good thing we don''t get scored on comment quality!) Like the tones and detail here.</td>', 'Whoopeeeeee! Ruupeeeeeee! (Ok, I know that was a dumb comment. good thing we don''t get scored on comment quality!) Like the tones and detail here.', '2008-11-04 20:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044105, 733119, 83313, '<td valign="top">A unique take on the theme. Kudos for the creativity.</td>', 'A unique take on the theme. Kudos for the creativity.', '2008-11-04 20:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044109, 733148, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ve heard about this system of identifying bills. Neat idea to illustrate this. Comp is a little too centered for me, but I think that''s more an opinion thing than a flaw.</td>', 'I''ve heard about this system of identifying bills. Neat idea to illustrate this. Comp is a little too centered for me, but I think that''s more an opinion thing than a flaw.', '2008-11-04 20:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044116, 733614, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and lighting is perfect. This would make a good stock shot. I can see an image like this used in magazine ads.</td>', 'Very sharp and lighting is perfect. This would make a good stock shot. I can see an image like this used in magazine ads.', '2008-11-04 20:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044123, 734507, 83313, '<td valign="top">Reminds me a little of those arcade games where they push the coins off a ledge. But a lot neater.</td>', 'Reminds me a little of those arcade games where they push the coins off a ledge. But a lot neater.', '2008-11-04 20:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044130, 733641, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little high key for me, but a great idea. This is another one that can be a great stock shot.</td>', 'A little high key for me, but a great idea. This is another one that can be a great stock shot.', '2008-11-04 20:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044134, 734179, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the low key approach. It''s not used nearly as often as high key. A nice "change".</td>', 'I like the low key approach. It''s not used nearly as often as high key. A nice "change".', '2008-11-04 20:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044143, 734514, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fun. Reminds me a little of the comedian Gallagher.</td>', 'Fun. Reminds me a little of the comedian Gallagher.', '2008-11-04 20:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044159, 734261, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure here. It''s sharp, but it does not seem sharp when I look at the whole image. I''m not sure if it''s the lighting, or the fact that you did a closeup of such a worn and scratched coin. Not great, but not bad for me either. I don''t find the orange background adds to it.</td>', 'I''m not sure here. It''s sharp, but it does not seem sharp when I look at the whole image. I''m not sure if it''s the lighting, or the fact that you did a closeup of such a worn and scratched coin. Not great, but not bad for me either. I don''t find the orange background adds to it.', '2008-11-04 20:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044163, 733699, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, though maybe could use a touch more lighting on the front of the coin.</td>', 'Nice, though maybe could use a touch more lighting on the front of the coin.', '2008-11-04 20:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044325, 734339, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and reflection. There''s quite a bit of grainy noise on the background, though. I thought it might be it''s texture, but if that was the case, there would be no reflection. Curious to see what your shot settings were. I''m not sure if you could have done this differently to avoid that noise or not.</td>', 'Nice lighting and reflection. There''s quite a bit of grainy noise on the background, though. I thought it might be it''s texture, but if that was the case, there would be no reflection. Curious to see what your shot settings were. I''m not sure if you could have done this differently to avoid that noise or not.', '2008-11-04 22:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044330, 734579, 83313, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of great euphemisms for the economy coming from this challenge. Another one I like.</td>', 'There''s a lot of great euphemisms for the economy coming from this challenge. Another one I like.', '2008-11-04 22:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044341, 734177, 83313, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like the same grainy background that I just saw in an entry of a Canadian penny. Not sure how it is looking like noisy grain, but with such a sharp reflection. I''ll be checking back on this and the other one after the challenge.<br/> <br/>As far as the shot, I think it''s a good effort, but the subject IMO, needs to be a bit larger in the frame. There''s just too much background and not enough subject for me.</td>', 'This almost looks like the same grainy background that I just saw in an entry of a Canadian penny. Not sure how it is looking like noisy grain, but with such a sharp reflection. I''ll be checking back on this and the other one after the challenge. As far as the shot, I think it''s a good effort, but the subject IMO, needs to be a bit larger in the frame. There''s just too much background and not enough subject for me.', '2008-11-04 22:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044377, 734481, 31664, '<td valign="top">very sharp, well lit, great capture.</td>', 'very sharp, well lit, great capture.', '2008-11-04 22:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044382, 734490, 31664, '<td valign="top">cool shot and concept</td>', 'cool shot and concept', '2008-11-04 22:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
