(5044732, 733119, 67697, '<td valign="top">ahh - so you are going all James Bond on us.  Well I gave it a 6.  I wasn''t sure if you were trying to convey that one could be rich enough to be whomever they wanted to be? Great photo. The DOF looks great!  (running off to the mirror challenge now to see if you followed thru on your threat/promise hahahahaha)</td>', 'ahh - so you are going all James Bond on us.  Well I gave it a 6.  I wasn''t sure if you were trying to convey that one could be rich enough to be whomever they wanted to be? Great photo. The DOF looks great!  (running off to the mirror challenge now to see if you followed thru on your threat/promise hahahahaha)', '2008-11-05 00:16:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5044746, 734239, 67697, '<td valign="top">you are such a gooof lol.  I have to say that I did like the title!  I was like - where''s the money?  He (and I am not even sure which is the actual "he") could have at least waved a few $$$ lol.  Well, I hope you had fun with this.  Seems to be a tamer version of your "birdie" shot lol!<br/> <br/>Congrats on the brown!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-05 00:20:04.</i></td>', 'you are such a gooof lol.  I have to say that I did like the title!  I was like - where''s the money?  He (and I am not even sure which is the actual "he") could have at least waved a few $$$ lol.  Well, I hope you had fun with this.  Seems to be a tamer version of your "birdie" shot lol! Congrats on the brown!', '2008-11-05 00:19:48.000000', '2008-11-05 00:20:04.000000', 0),
