(5045076, 734481, 61818, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the message you were trying to convey at all.  The coin doesn''t appear to be sinking and I don''t see how the water drop adds to the idea of currency or economies sinking.  It almost looks like the coin was just set there to give some sort of generic theme relevance to what is otherwise a water drop shot.</td>', 'I don''t get the message you were trying to convey at all.  The coin doesn''t appear to be sinking and I don''t see how the water drop adds to the idea of currency or economies sinking.  It almost looks like the coin was just set there to give some sort of generic theme relevance to what is otherwise a water drop shot.', '2008-11-05 01:35:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5045088, 733447, 92546, '<td valign="top">Nice work Heisch! Another great one.</td>', 'Nice work Heisch! Another great one.', '2008-11-05 01:40:27.000000', NULL, 0),
