(5045128, 734481, 97270, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot in many ways. I think Irene should be awarded the DPC Nobel prize for always finding creative ways to capture water drops.<br/> <br/>But, I agree with the previous post. The drop, as beautiful as it is, doesnt add to the message that the title suggests. It may have meant something if the drop was focussed dead on the coin.. almost like some power trying to sink the economy. As it is, the drop is meaningless... unless you can explain the meaning;-)<br/> <br/>However, I know how hard it is to catch a single drop in action.. I have wasted almost 500 shots last week to no avail, so I salute you for that.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is a great shot in many ways. I think Irene should be awarded the DPC Nobel prize for always finding creative ways to capture water drops. But, I agree with the previous post. The drop, as beautiful as it is, doesnt add to the message that the title suggests. It may have meant something if the drop was focussed dead on the coin.. almost like some power trying to sink the economy. As it is, the drop is meaningless... unless you can explain the meaning;-) However, I know how hard it is to catch a single drop in action.. I have wasted almost 500 shots last week to no avail, so I salute you for that. ', '2008-11-05 02:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
