(5046982, 734568, 811, '<td valign="top">I saw the words money, but didn''t realize it was a reflection.  I gave it a 5, but doubt that it would change, even if I had know.<br/> <br/>To me, the composition is simply to "static."  It is centered both horizontally and vertically, and doesn''t have a real sense of "depth" to it.  You met the challenge, and it seems to be fairly well focused, but beyond that, there isn''t much to compel the viewer to ponder it longer.</td>', 'I saw the words money, but didn''t realize it was a reflection.  I gave it a 5, but doubt that it would change, even if I had know. To me, the composition is simply to "static."  It is centered both horizontally and vertically, and doesn''t have a real sense of "depth" to it.  You met the challenge, and it seems to be fairly well focused, but beyond that, there isn''t much to compel the viewer to ponder it longer.', '2008-11-05 15:59:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5047058, 734239, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PhotoInterest:</b></div><hr/><i>  The way that I see it is that no matter what I do, my scores are going to be low (there''s also a lot of inconsistent and whacky voting going on in here lately)</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>are you <b>serious</b> with this statement? Your top 3 challenge entries are all above 6. Do you know how many people on this site would love to say that? Is this some false modesty or were you just saying that tongue-in-cheek?</td>', 'Originally posted by PhotoInterest:  The way that I see it is that no matter what I do, my scores are going to be low (there''s also a lot of inconsistent and whacky voting going on in here lately)  are you serious with this statement? Your top 3 challenge entries are all above 6. Do you know how many people on this site would love to say that? Is this some false modesty or were you just saying that tongue-in-cheek?', '2008-11-05 16:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5047059, 734239, 68947, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smardaz:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PhotoInterest:</b></div><hr/><i>  The way that I see it is that no matter what I do, my scores are going to be low (there''s also a lot of inconsistent and whacky voting going on in here lately)</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>are you <b>serious</b> with this statement? Your top 3 challenge entries are all above 6. Do you know how many people on this site would love to say that? Is this some false modesty or were you just saying that tongue-in-cheek? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Tongue In Cheek....just like my entry! :P</td>', 'Originally posted by smardaz: Originally posted by PhotoInterest:  The way that I see it is that no matter what I do, my scores are going to be low (there''s also a lot of inconsistent and whacky voting going on in here lately)  are you serious with this statement? Your top 3 challenge entries are all above 6. Do you know how many people on this site would love to say that? Is this some false modesty or were you just saying that tongue-in-cheek?   Tongue In Cheek....just like my entry! :P', '2008-11-05 16:37:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5047065, 734590, 60495, '<td valign="top">Great job Tom, really fun idea!</td>', 'Great job Tom, really fun idea!', '2008-11-05 16:40:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5047066, 734239, 68947, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> you are such a gooof lol.  I have to say that I did like the title!  I was like - where''s the money?  He (and I am not even sure which is the actual "he") could have at least waved a few $$$ lol.  Well, I hope you had fun with this.  Seems to be a tamer version of your "birdie" shot lol!<br/> <br/>Congrats on the brown! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL...I did get a laugh out of this, even if no one else saw it.  It''s the guy with the fancy jacket on...cigarette in hand, looking at the girl off in the distance (top of shot).  I watched this guy check out every girl walking down the street.  He had just said something to the woman walking away at the top of the shot and she kept right on walking, he kept right on looking...until the next woman walked by that is.  <br/> <br/>Unfortunately, just as I snapped that shot, those other 2 (left hand side) stepped into the shot and stopped right there.  I snapped and the guy I was aiming at, turned to spot me with the camera!  Put it down at that point! LOL</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: you are such a gooof lol.  I have to say that I did like the title!  I was like - where''s the money?  He (and I am not even sure which is the actual "he") could have at least waved a few $$$ lol.  Well, I hope you had fun with this.  Seems to be a tamer version of your "birdie" shot lol! Congrats on the brown!   LOL...I did get a laugh out of this, even if no one else saw it.  It''s the guy with the fancy jacket on...cigarette in hand, looking at the girl off in the distance (top of shot).  I watched this guy check out every girl walking down the street.  He had just said something to the woman walking away at the top of the shot and she kept right on walking, he kept right on looking...until the next woman walked by that is.   Unfortunately, just as I snapped that shot, those other 2 (left hand side) stepped into the shot and stopped right there.  I snapped and the guy I was aiming at, turned to spot me with the camera!  Put it down at that point! LOL', '2008-11-05 16:42:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5047103, 734568, 63269, '<td valign="top">NOW I see the highlighted money/yenom thing - forgive me for being so blind. Perhaps doing a rule of thirds composition might have helped, I don''t know. It''s difficultl to figure out how to create composition for square/round objects like this.... Also, maybe a slightly different angle? I think I see now that this is a stack of coins - but when I first looked at it, I thought it was some sort of flat metal plaque. A different point of view might have helped voters see the cleverness of your concept here.</td>', 'NOW I see the highlighted money/yenom thing - forgive me for being so blind. Perhaps doing a rule of thirds composition might have helped, I don''t know. It''s difficultl to figure out how to create composition for square/round objects like this.... Also, maybe a slightly different angle? I think I see now that this is a stack of coins - but when I first looked at it, I thought it was some sort of flat metal plaque. A different point of view might have helped voters see the cleverness of your concept here.', '2008-11-05 17:00:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5047143, 734239, 68947, '<td valign="top">Perhaps, I should have entered this shot LOL...he''d just propositioned the 3 girls at the back of the shot there.  They look like they were looking at me...but, in actual fact, they were looking at a girl that was walking beside me, going towards them.  It really made me laugh because he had just gone on with smoking his cigarette as though none of this had happened.  It was kind of like a little "soap opera" going on that day everywhere.  A story to practically every shot I took that day.  <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=736904" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/68947/120/736904.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/68947/120/736904.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/68947/120/736904.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Perhaps, I should have entered this shot LOL...he''d just propositioned the 3 girls at the back of the shot there.  They look like they were looking at me...but, in actual fact, they were looking at a girl that was walking beside me, going towards them.  It really made me laugh because he had just gone on with smoking his cigarette as though none of this had happened.  It was kind of like a little "soap opera" going on that day everywhere.  A story to practically every shot I took that day.   ', '2008-11-05 17:14:05.000000', NULL, 0),
