(5048867, 734504, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nice bullion. Good work on the modeling.<br/>Poor choice of background colour though.<br/>With that lens you could have achieved a better image i''m sure. Can''t really tell where the focus point is. I would have chosen a bigger aperture and focused on the coins. This would have made the bullion blurry and given this shot an overall more interesting feel.</td>', 'Nice bullion. Good work on the modeling.Poor choice of background colour though.With that lens you could have achieved a better image i''m sure. Can''t really tell where the focus point is. I would have chosen a bigger aperture and focused on the coins. This would have made the bullion blurry and given this shot an overall more interesting feel.', '2008-11-06 13:15:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5049115, 733156, 67763, '<td valign="top">That is just great!  I received the same kind of Christmas Bonus myself.  Carolyn isn''t the only one so special! Hopefully, all that stuff she makes that looks good enough to eat will let her have a bonus this year. Nice DOF! B&amp;W worked really well. Some nice shots on your www, Michelle.<br/> <br/>Carolyn and yourself are both really Wyse and will go far! (that was terrible!)<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/> <br/>Ken</td>', 'That is just great!  I received the same kind of Christmas Bonus myself.  Carolyn isn''t the only one so special! Hopefully, all that stuff she makes that looks good enough to eat will let her have a bonus this year. Nice DOF! B&W worked really well. Some nice shots on your www, Michelle. Carolyn and yourself are both really Wyse and will go far! (that was terrible!) Regards, Ken', '2008-11-06 15:49:13.000000', NULL, 0),
