(5074576, 733278, 24486, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Congrats on the 9th placing &amp; the new personal best. Is it my imagination or is the queens face on the front coin frowning at all the others? I like your set up. Just goes to prove you don''t need all the sofisticated studio gear to achieve a great shot. Well done.<br/> <br/><i>Edit; for spelling</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-19 22:14:58.</i></td>', 'I really like this. Congrats on the 9th placing & the new personal best. Is it my imagination or is the queens face on the front coin frowning at all the others? I like your set up. Just goes to prove you don''t need all the sofisticated studio gear to achieve a great shot. Well done. Edit; for spelling', '2008-11-19 22:13:35.000000', '2008-11-19 22:14:58.000000', 0),
